          {
            "title": "Class Methods",
            "id": 88765,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Klasy mogą również zawierać funkcje, które nazywa się <strong>metodami</strong>, gdy znajdują się wewnątrz klasy. Tak jak metoda <code>bark()</code> tutaj.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Virtual_Pet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"bark\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bark&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky = Virtual_Pet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky.bark()\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Bark\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Self",
            "id": 89349,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>self</code> to specjalne słowo kluczowe, którego musimy używać wewnątrz definicji naszej klasy. Przekazujemy <code>self</code> jako pierwszy parametr do wszystkich dodawanych metod.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Virtual_Pet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"bark\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bark&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky = Virtual_Pet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky.bark()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bark\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>self</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Używasz <code>self</code> jako pierwszego parametru każdej metody definiowanej w klasie.</p><p>Uzupełnij definicję metody <code>bark</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Virtual_Pet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"bark\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bark&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky = Virtual_Pet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky.bark()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"class\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"rocky\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"color\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bark\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>def</code>, a następnie <code>self</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Self",
            "id": 88784,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Używamy <code>self</code> jako parametru w metodach klasy, aby uzyskać dostęp do zmiennych klasowych, takich jak <code>color</code> i <code>legs</code>, wewnątrz metod.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Virtual_Pet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  legs = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"bark\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bark&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display_color\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(self.color)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display_legs\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(self.legs)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky = Virtual_Pet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky.display_color()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky.display_legs()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"127\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"brown\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>self</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Self",
            "id": 89350,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wewnątrz <code>display_color()</code> za pomocą <code>self.color</code> uzyskujemy dostęp do wartości zmiennej klasowej <code>color = \"brown\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Virtual_Pet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  legs = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"bark\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bark&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display_color\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(self.color)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display_legs\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(self.legs)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky = Virtual_Pet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky.display_color()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky.display_legs()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"127\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"128\" /><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"133\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"brown\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>self</code>, następnie <code>.</code> i na końcu <code>color</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wewnątrz metody używasz <code>self</code> i kropki, aby uzyskać dostęp do zmiennej klasowej, jak w <code>self.color</code>.</p><p>Spraw, aby <code>display_color</code> wyświetliła kolor, dzięki czemu program wyświetli kolejno <code>brown</code> i <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Virtual_Pet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  legs = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"bark\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bark&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display_color\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(self.color)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display_legs\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(self.legs)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky = Virtual_Pet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky.display_color()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky.display_legs()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"127\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"128\" /><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"legs\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"bark\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"brown\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>self</code>, następnie <code>.</code> i na końcu <code>color</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
